# Generated pages.
#
# Every .html file at the root of this repo is written by build.py from
# build.py itself plus src/. They are deliberately not committed: two people
# editing a page and its generator at once produces merge conflicts in files
# nobody is supposed to hand-edit, and the resolution is always "rerun the
# build" — which git has no way of knowing.
#
# Vercel builds them on deploy; see buildCommand in vercel.json.
# To see the site locally: python3 build.py && open index.html
#
# src/clipped-web.html is NOT generated and IS committed — it is the source
# the Clipped Browser page is copied from.
/*.html

# QA scaffolding, never part of the site
node_modules/
package.json
package-lock.json
qa-fonts.css
fonts/
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# screenshots taken while checking work
/*.png
